OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and scattered
OL,6,Fshowers feed in from the northwest
OL,7,Fthrough the day, these showers
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy and turning
OL,9,Fthundery at times. Showers most
OL,10,Ffrequent over north Argyll.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FClear spells and scattered
OL,13,Fshowers through the evening, a few of
OL,14,Fthese heavy at first. Showers
OL,15,Fincreasingly confined to the coast
OL,16,Fovernight with longer clear spells
OL,17,Fdeveloping.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
