OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FDry and bright for many in
OL,6,Fthe morning, but a few showers around
OL,7,Fthe isles. Cloudier afternoon with
OL,8,Fsome showers before a band of heavy
OL,9,Frain pushes east in evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FFrequent heavy and blustery showers on
OL,13,FThursday. Showers easing Friday
OL,14,Fmorning, becoming dry and bright,
OL,15,Fbefore a band of rain spreads east
OL,16,Flater. Bright spells and scattered
OL,17,Fshowers on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
